[4.195731, "o", "        # Public FDA Label Data\r\n\r\n        This directory contains only public task inputs for `fda-hard-near-miss-refusal`.\r\n\r\n        - `labels.jsonl` has full FDA label rows with `label_raw` and `chunks`.\r\n        - `questions.jsonl` has 6 public questions.\r\n        - Gold answers, references, citations, and curated context are not included here.\r\n\r\n        Labels included:\r\n        - 12HR Allergy Relief (`ea5d0e55-2191-4094-b082-24b317f95752`)\r\n- Acamprosate Calcium (`ae6e79c0-a307-4888-b647-1b7be4cb9127`)\r\n- Acclean Chlorhexidine Gluconate 0.12% Oral Rinse (`08c9d3dd-717b-0148-e054-00144ff8d46c`)\r\n"]
