[45.69822, "o", "========================================\r\nQID: near-miss-04f3afa658fdef\r\nQID: near-miss-04f3afa658fdef\r\nQUESTION: The 12HR Allergy Relief label discusses warnings. Does it provide a supported recommendation for pharmacogenomic testing requirement? Answer NOT_FOUND if the label does not support it, and cite the section you searched.\r\n--- Passages found in block ---\r\n========================================\r\nQID: near-miss-0c6ec72416151f\r\nQID: near-miss-0c6ec72416151f\r\nQUESTION: The Acamprosate Calcium label discusses renal impairment. Does it provide a supported recommendation for severe hepatic impairment? Answer NOT_FOUND if the label does not support it, and cite the section you searched.\r\n--- Passages found in block ---\r\n========================================\r\nQID: near-miss-bd69d0bfb1fc7d\r\nQID: near-miss-bd69d0bfb1fc7d\r\nQUESTION: The Acamprosate Calcium label discusses pregnancy. Does it provide a supported recommendation for breastfeeding dose adjustment? Answer NOT_FOUND if the label does not support it, and cite the section you searched.\r\n--- Passages found in block ---\r\n========================================\r\nQID: near-miss-d4ca1884aa8ab4\r\nQID: near-miss-d4ca1884aa8ab4\r\nQUESTION: The Acamprosate Calcium label discusses adverse reactions. Does it provide a supported recommendation for therapeutic drug monitoring target range? Answer NOT_FOUND if the label does not support it, and cite the section you searched.\r\n--- Passages found in block ---\r\n"]
