[67.711438, "o", "label_raw:\r\n||PASSAGE_0000||\r\nUses\r\ntemporarily relieves these symptoms due to hay fever or other upper respiratory allergies:\r\n- runny nose\r\n- sneezing\r\n- itchy, watery eyes\r\n- itching of the nose or throat\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0001||\r\nDo not use if you have ever had an allergic reaction to this product or any of its ingredients.\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0002||\r\nAsk a doctor before use if you have kidney disease.  Your doctor should determine if you need a different dose.\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0003||\r\n- do not take more than directed\r\n- do not take at the same time as aluminum or magnesium antacids\r\n- do not take with fruit juices\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0004||\r\nStop use and ask a doctor if an allergic reaction to this product occurs.  Seek medical help right away.\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0005||\r\nIf pregnant or breast-feeding, ask a health professional before use.\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0006||\r\nKeep out of reach of children. In case of overdose, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away (1-800-222-1222).\r\n\r\n||PASSAGE_0007||\r\nadults and children 12 years of age and\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n0: 'Uses\\ntemporarily relieves these symptoms due to hay fever or other upper respiratory allergies:\\n- runny nose\\n- sneezing\\n- itchy, watery eyes\\n- itching of the nose or throat'\r\n1: 'Do not use\\xa0if you have ever had an allergic reaction to this product or any of its ingredients.'\r\n2: 'Ask a doctor before use if you have kidney disease.\\xa0 Your doctor should determine if you need a different dose.'\r\n3: '- do not take more than directed\\n- do not take at the same time as aluminum or magnesium antacids\\n- do not take with fruit juices'\r\n4: 'Stop use and ask a doctor if an allergic reaction to this product occurs.\\xa0 Seek medical help right away.'\r\n5: 'If pregnant or breast-feeding,\\xa0ask a health professional before use.'\r\n6: 'Keep out of reach of children. In case of overdose, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away (1-800-222-1222).'\r\n7: 'adults and children 12 years of age and over take one 60 mg tablet with water every 12 hours; do not take more than 2 tablets in 24 hours'\r\n"]
[67.711524, "o", "8: 'do not use\\nadults 65 years of age and older'\r\n9: '- store between 20-25°C (68-77°F)\\n- protect from excessive moisture\\n- retain carton for complete product information and warnings'\r\n10: 'colloidal silicon dioxide, croscarmellose sodium, hypromellose, iron oxide black, iron oxide red, iron oxide yellow, lactose monohydrate, macrogol, magnesium stearate, microcrystalline cellulose, pregelatinized starch, titanium dioxide'\r\n11: 'Antihistamine\\nIndoor/Outdoor Relief of:'\r\n12: 'Actual Size\\nCOMPARE TO ALLEGRA® 12 HOUR ALLERGY active ingredient*'\r\n"]
