88-b647-1b7be4cb9127\",\n                \"passage_id\": \"PASSAGE_0033\",\n                \"section\": \"8.4 Pediatric Use\",\n                \"supporting_quote\": \"The safety and efficacy of acamprosate calcium have not been established in the pediatric population.\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"structured_fields\": {\n            \"searched_topic\": \"pediatric\",\n            \""]
